# Privileged credentials are injected by the environment; do not add values here.
# supabase_secret
# supabase_service_role_secret
# Nextapp_token_access
# RESEND_API_KEY (server-only worker credential; never NEXT_PUBLIC)
# RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET (server-only signing secret from Resend webhook settings)
# REMINDER_RUNNER_SECRET (generated server-only signing key in Vercel and Supabase Vault)
# GLOW_PROXY_SECRET (future VPS only: >=32 random characters; trusted reverse proxy
# overwrites X-Glow-Proxy-Key and X-Real-IP; Node port must not be public)
# VERCEL_TOKEN (development/Actions deployment only, never application runtime)
